Programs run over several weeks. LogIt has ready-made ones you can copy into a split and change; your
coach can also give you programs they've written.

## A program from your coach

It appears under Splits › From your coach. If your coach set it to start when you're ready, tap Start program.
Each workout from it loads the day's sets, with loads worked out from your own lifts when your coach
wrote them as a percentage.

